against-marcion-v-iv-3211"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3212]: Magis quam foveat.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3212"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3213]: 1 Cor. x. 11 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3213"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3214]: 1 Cor. x. 25–27 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3214"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3215]: Novationem.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3215"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3216]: 1 Cor. xi. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3216"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3217]: 1 Cor. xi. 7 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3217"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3218]: Gen. i. 26 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3218"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3219]: 1 Cor. xi. 10 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3219"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3220]: 1 Cor. xi. 9 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3220"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3221]: 1 Cor. xi. 10 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3221"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3222]: See more concerning these in chap. xviii. of this book. Comp. Gen. vi. 1–4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3222"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3223]: 1 Cor. xi. 18, 19 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3223"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3224]: Probabiles: “approved.”","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3224"},{"text":"[^tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3225]: See above, in book iv. chap. xl.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"tertullian-against-marcion-v-iv-3225"}],"chars":13836,"notes":{}}
